### ===========================================
### Traffic Lights API Tests
### ===========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionId = paste-JSESSIONID-value-from-browser
@csrfToken = paste-_csrf-meta-content-from-authenticated-page

### Authentication notes
### Log in through http://localhost:8080/login, then open an authenticated page in the browser.
### Copy the JSESSIONID cookie value and the <meta name="_csrf" content="..."> value above.
### Protected mutations below demonstrate the cookie and CSRF header required by Spring Security.

### GET public cached status search - 200 OK or 204 No Content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/search?status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

### GET public traffic lights for the standalone Week 10 client - 200 OK or 204 No Content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### POST public traffic light for the standalone Week 10 client - 201 Created
### This dedicated endpoint intentionally requires neither a session cookie nor a CSRF token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2024-01-15",
  "direction": "N",
  "type": "COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 1
}

### GET all traffic lights while signed in - 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}

### GET single traffic light while signed in - 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/1
Accept: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}

### GET single traffic light while signed in - 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}

### POST create traffic light - 201 Created
### NOTE: This endpoint requires authentication.
### The browser UI reads the CSRF header name and token from Thymeleaf meta tags.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2024-01-15",
  "direction": "N",
  "type": "COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 1
}

### POST create traffic light - 400 Bad Request (missing required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "rightArrow": true
}

### POST create traffic light - 400 Bad Request (future installation date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2030-12-31",
  "direction": "S",
  "type": "NON_COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 1
}

### POST create traffic light - 404 Not Found (non-existent intersection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2024-01-15",
  "direction": "E",
  "type": "COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 9999
}

### DELETE traffic light - 204 No Content
### WARNING: This will actually delete the traffic light!
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/5
Accept: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### DELETE non-existent traffic light - 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### PATCH traffic light - 204 No Content (update status only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

### PATCH traffic light - 204 No Content (update multiple fields)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "direction": "SW",
  "rightArrow": true
}

### PATCH traffic light - 404 Not Found
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/traffic-lights/9999
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

